I never zap damage-attack wands.

-- Wands of fire and lightning are used to engrave Elbereth, at which
point I no longer need attack wands.
-- Wands of striking are saved to break boulders and drawbridges.
-- Wands of magic missile are saved for zapping monsters hiding behind
boulders in Sokoban, and discarded after Soko is finished.
-- Wands of cold are all dropped except for one, which I hang onto to
freeze water where drawbridges used to be.

These aren't damage-attack wands but should be mentioned for the sake of
completeness:

-- Wands of sleep are used if a single non-sleep-resistant monster
(*cough*minotaur) is actually doing damage to me, or actually in a
number of early-game situations to avoid getting low on HP.
-- Wands of death are reserved for Rodney, the high priest, and the
priests/Riders on Astral.

